  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Sometime in 1970s, Mok-ryeon, raised in an orphanage, endures hardships and finally finds a loving husband, leading a happy life. However, she witnesses him cheating on her with his friend and dies in an accident. Time passes, and Mok-ryeon, reincarnated as Ahn Hye-seo, resolves not to love in this life. However, on her first day of high school, Yoo Seong-ha, who looks exactly like her husband from her previous life, appears, shaking her resolve.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=843128), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13177886) \n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/no-more-love/list?title_no=9273)",
